{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36647","headline":"杜陵秋思 · 罗隐","name":"杜陵秋思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南望商於北帝都，两堪栖托两无图。\n只闻斥逐张公子，不觉悲同楚大夫。\n岩畔早凉生紫桂，井边疎影落高梧。\n一杯渌酒他年忆，沥向青波寄五湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36647.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36647","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}